# 2026-10-02: Despertar por tier (decisao do usuario). Cada tier tem a sua meta e acorda sozinho quando ela e
# cumprida, desde que o nivel o libere (passiva de tier: 3 / 7 / 12). Os tiers somam e ficam ate o fim do
# combate. Metas: Fool 3/4/5 inimigos numa rodada, Empress 3/5/7 Sigils, Star 5x/8x/12x o nivel em cura,
# Death 30/50/70% do HP maximo perdido. O Osiris (ARCANA_Aspect_*.txt) conta e acorda; aqui ficam os status.
#
# ASPECT_AWAKENED_<X> vira tecnico (Tier I alcancado): libera a carta do Aspecto e o VFX, e e o que o CardDB,
# a SIGIL e o Osiris olham. Quem aparece e o status do tier (ASPECT_AWAKENED_<X>_I/II/III, mesmo StackId com
# prioridade). Cada um carrega os bonus de todos os tiers ate ele, porque o de cima substitui o de baixo.
# O padrao de UI do Fool (passiva Awakening visivel, tiers escondidos) vale agora para as quatro subclasses.

@loca FOOL_AWAKE_DESC Strike different enemies with attacks within a single round to awaken the Aspect of Curiosity until combat ends. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>If fewer enemies stand when your turn begins than a goal asks for, strikes on any enemy count towards that goal instead.<br><br>Level 3: strike 3 different enemies to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_I">Wanderlust</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: strike 4 different enemies to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_II">Restless Wind</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: strike 5 different enemies to awaken as the <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_III">Aspect of Curiosity</LSTag>.
@loca FOOL_PROGRESS_DESC Hits that count towards your next Awakening tier this round. Resets when your turn begins.

@loca EMPRESS_AWAKE_DESC Detonate your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigils</LSTag> during a fight to awaken the Aspect of Love until combat ends. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>Level 3: detonate 3 Sigils to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_I">Obsession</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: detonate 5 Sigils to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_II">Devotion</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: detonate 7 Sigils to awaken as the <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_III">Aspect of Love</LSTag>.
@loca EMPRESS_I_NAME Obsession
@loca EMPRESS_I_DESC Creatures marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.
@loca EMPRESS_II_NAME Devotion
@loca EMPRESS_II_DESC Once per turn, when one of your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigils</LSTag> detonates, the nearest unmarked enemy within [1] of it is marked with a Sigil.
@loca EMPRESS_III_NAME Aspect of Love
@loca EMPRESS_III_DESC Your Charisma increases by [1] and your Arcane spells add your Charisma Modifier to their damage. Once per round, when an enemy attacks you, it must succeed a Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throw</LSTag> or its attack is stopped and it is <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> for 1 turn.
@loca EMPRESS_PROGRESS_DESC Sigils you have detonated this fight, towards your next Awakening tier.
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_I_NAME 3 - The Empress: Awakened I
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_I_DESC Obsession: Creatures marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_II_NAME 3 - The Empress: Awakened II
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_II_DESC Obsession: Creatures marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.<br><br>Devotion: Once per turn, when one of your Sigils detonates, the nearest unmarked enemy within [1] of it is marked with a Sigil.
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_III_NAME 3 - The Empress: Awakened III
@loca EMPRESS_TIER_III_DESC Obsession: Creatures marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.<br><br>Devotion: Once per turn, when one of your Sigils detonates, the nearest unmarked enemy within [1] of it is marked with a Sigil.<br><br>Aspect of Love: Your Charisma increases by [2] and your Arcane spells add your Charisma Modifier to their damage. Once per round, when an enemy attacks you, it must succeed a Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throw</LSTag> or its attack is stopped and it is <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> for 1 turn.

@loca STAR_AWAKE_DESC Heal your allies during a fight to awaken the Aspect of Hope until combat ends. Healing beyond an ally's maximum <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag> doesn't count. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>Level 3: restore hit points equal to 5 times your level to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_I">Beacon</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: restore 8 times your level to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_II">Sunrise</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: restore 12 times your level to awaken as the <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_III">Aspect of Hope</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_I_NAME Beacon
@loca STAR_I_DESC Allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_MOONLIT">Moonlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [1] and reduces the target's <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">movement speed</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_II_NAME Sunrise
@loca STAR_II_DESC Moonlit deals [1] instead, and allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell also become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_SUNLIT">Sunlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [2] and sets the target <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING">Burning</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_III_NAME Aspect of Hope
@loca STAR_III_DESC Your Wisdom increases by [1], Sunlit deals [2] instead, and allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell gain <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_ECLIPSE">Eclipse</LSTag>, becoming <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to Cold and Fire damage. The first ally who would be downed during the fight instead regains half their <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_PROGRESS_DESC Progress towards your next Awakening tier, in percent.
@loca STAR_TIER_I_NAME 17 - The Star: Awakened I
@loca STAR_TIER_I_DESC Beacon: Allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_MOONLIT">Moonlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [1] and reduces the target's <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">movement speed</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_TIER_II_NAME 17 - The Star: Awakened II
@loca STAR_TIER_II_DESC Beacon: Allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_MOONLIT">Moonlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [1] and reduces the target's <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">movement speed</LSTag>.<br><br>Sunrise: Moonlit deals [2] instead, and allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell also become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_SUNLIT">Sunlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [3] and sets the target <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING">Burning</LSTag>.
@loca STAR_TIER_III_NAME 17 - The Star: Awakened III
@loca STAR_TIER_III_DESC Beacon: Allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_MOONLIT">Moonlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [1] and reduces the target's <LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed">movement speed</LSTag>.<br><br>Sunrise: Moonlit deals [2] instead, and allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell also become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_SUNLIT">Sunlit</LSTag>: their next attack that hits deals an additional [3] and sets the target <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING">Burning</LSTag>.<br><br>Aspect of Hope: Your Wisdom increases by [4], Sunlit deals [5] instead, and allies you heal or target with an Arcane spell gain <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STAR_ECLIPSE">Eclipse</LSTag>, becoming <LSTag Tooltip="Resistant">Resistant</LSTag> to Cold and Fire damage. The first ally who would be downed during the fight instead regains half their <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag>.

@loca DEATH_AWAKE_DESC Lose <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag> during a fight to awaken the Aspect of Sorrow until combat ends. Healing doesn't undo the loss. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>Level 3: lose 30% of your hit point maximum to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_I">Sorrow</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: lose 50% to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_II">Mourning</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: lose 70% to awaken as the <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_III">Aspect of Sorrow</LSTag>.
@loca DEATH_I_NAME Sorrow
@loca DEATH_I_DESC You emanate <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DARKNESS_RISE_AURA">Darkness Rise</LSTag>.
@loca DEATH_II_NAME Mourning
@loca DEATH_II_DESC The first time you would drop to 0 <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag>, you drop to 1 instead, and an isolated enemy within [1] of you has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.
@loca DEATH_III_NAME Aspect of Sorrow
@loca DEATH_III_DESC Your Constitution increases by [1]. Once per turn, when a hostile creature dies within [2] of you, you gain an additional action.
@loca DEATH_PROGRESS_DESC Progress towards your next Awakening tier, in percent.
@loca DEATH_TIER_I_NAME 13 - Death: Awakened I
@loca DEATH_TIER_I_DESC Sorrow: You emanate <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DARKNESS_RISE_AURA">Darkness Rise</LSTag>.
@loca DEATH_TIER_II_NAME 13 - Death: Awakened II
@loca DEATH_TIER_II_DESC Sorrow: You emanate <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DARKNESS_RISE_AURA">Darkness Rise</LSTag>.<br><br>Mourning: The first time you would drop to 0 <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag>, you drop to 1 instead, and an isolated enemy within [1] of you has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.
@loca DEATH_TIER_III_NAME 13 - Death: Awakened III
@loca DEATH_TIER_III_DESC Sorrow: You emanate <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DARKNESS_RISE_AURA">Darkness Rise</LSTag>.<br><br>Mourning: The first time you would drop to 0 <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit points</LSTag>, you drop to 1 instead, and an isolated enemy within [1] of you has <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.<br><br>Aspect of Sorrow: Your Constitution increases by [2]. Once per turn, when a hostile creature dies within [3] of you, you gain an additional action.

# ---- passivas de tier: escondidas (aparecem pelas LSTags da passiva Awakening) ----
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_I Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_II Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_III Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_I Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_II Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_III Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_I Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_II Properties IsHidden
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_III Properties IsHidden

# ---- as passivas de tier continuam contando depois do Tier I (o Tier II e o III tem metas proprias) ----
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_I Conditions Combat() and IsAttack() and IsHit() and Enemy() and not WearingArmor(context.Source) and not HasShieldEquipped(context.Source);
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_I Conditions Combat() and not Self() and HealDoneGreaterThan(0);

# ---- os bonus deixam de olhar o nivel: quem libera agora e o status do tier ----
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_II BoostConditions not WearingArmor(context.Source) and not HasShieldEquipped(context.Source);
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_III BoostConditions not WearingArmor(context.Source) and not HasShieldEquipped(context.Source);
@unset Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_Awakened_III BoostConditions
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_Awakened_III_Damage Boosts IF(IsCardSpell() or IsArcanaCantrip()):DamageBonus(max(0, CharismaModifier));
@unset Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_Awakened_III BoostConditions
@unset Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Death_Awakened_III BoostConditions
@set Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_Awakened_Heal StatsFunctors IF(not (HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_II', context.Source) or HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_III', context.Source))):ApplyStatus(STAR_MOONLIT,100,2);IF((HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_II', context.Source) or HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_III', context.Source))):ApplyStatus(STAR_MOONLIT_II,100,2);IF(HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_II', context.Source)):ApplyStatus(STAR_SUNLIT,100,2);IF(HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_III', context.Source)):ApplyStatus(STAR_SUNLIT_II,100,2);IF(HasStatus('ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_III', context.Source)):ApplyStatus(STAR_ECLIPSE,100,2)

# ---- status tecnicos (Tier I alcancado): carta, VFX e a cura do Star; escondidos ----
@unset ASPECT_AWAKENED_FOOL Passives
@unset ASPECT_AWAKENED_FOOL OnApplyFunctors
@unset ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS Passives
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS StatusPropertyFlags IgnoreResting;DisableOverhead;DisableCombatlog;DisablePortraitIndicator
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS OnRemoveFunctors RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS_I);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS_II);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_EMPRESS_III)
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR Passives Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Star_Awakened_Heal
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR StatusPropertyFlags IgnoreResting;DisableOverhead;DisableCombatlog;DisablePortraitIndicator
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR OnRemoveFunctors RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_I);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_II);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_STAR_III)
@unset ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH Passives
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH StatusPropertyFlags IgnoreResting;DisableOverhead;DisableCombatlog;DisablePortraitIndicator
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH OnRemoveFunctors RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH_I);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH_II);RemoveStatus(ASPECT_AWAKENED_DEATH_III)

# ---- status de tier do Fool: agora carregam os bonus (o de cima substitui o de baixo, entao soma tudo) ----
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_FOOL_I Passives Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_I
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_FOOL_II Passives Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_I;Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_II
@set ASPECT_AWAKENED_FOOL_III Passives Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_I;Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_II;Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_Awakened_III

